{"94:1":"أَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَكَ صَ<rule class=qalaqah>دۡ</rule>رَكَ","94:2":"وَوَضَعۡنَا عَ<rule class=ikhafa>نك</rule>َ وِزۡرَكَ","94:3":"ٱلَّذ<rule class=madda_obligatory_monfasel>ِىٓ</rule> أَ<rule class=ikhafa>نق</rule>َضَ ظَهۡرَكَ","94:4":"وَرَفَعۡنَا لَكَ ذِكۡرَكَ","94:5":"فَإِ<rule class=ghunnah>نّ</rule>َ مَعَ <rule class=ham_wasl>ٱ</rule>لۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","94:6":"إِ<rule class=ghunnah>نّ</rule>َ مَعَ <rule class=ham_wasl>ٱ</rule>لۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","94:7":"فَإِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَ<rule class=ham_wasl>ٱ</rule><rule class=ikhafa>نص</rule>َ<rule class=qalaqah>بۡ</rule>","94:8":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَ<rule class=ham_wasl>ٱ</rule>رۡغَ<rule class=qalaqah>ب</rule>"}